  "title": "Beyond deepfake detection: building resilient identity systems",
  "summary": "We are in a new era of identity fraud. The tools being used by attackers today – think AI-generated deepfakes, synthetic media, and coordinated injection attacks – go beyond being incremental improvements on yesterday’s attacks. In many ways, fraudsters’ prosthetic masks and printed photos look quaint by comparison. Today’s attacks are fundamentally different, highly sophisticated threats that target a critical vulnerability in most identity verification systems: the belief that one detection layer is sufficient.",
